{"id":4612,"date":"2025-07-07T10:14:03","date_gmt":"2025-07-07T10:14:03","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4612"},"modified":"2025-08-11T07:00:37","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T07:00:37","slug":"cach-live-tren-tiktok-sieu-de","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/tin-tuc\/cach-live-tren-tiktok-sieu-de\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch live tr\u00ean TikTok si\u00eau d\u1ec5 cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1edbi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"PlWJdEDOKoIrRAxm9nTlIpiqgTb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OMmedaFVAoJWHqxYLYplGy8Agke\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u00e1ch live tr\u00ean TikTok l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch tuy\u1ec7t v\u1eddi \u0111\u1ec3 k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem, x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o ra thu nh\u1eadp t\u1eeb qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u1ea3o ho\u1eb7c b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng. V\u1edbi kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c cao v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn l\u01b0\u1ee3ng l\u1edbn ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng, \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 thi\u1ebfu cho nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi kinh doanh online. C\u00f9ng <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\">Lemon Digital<\/span><\/strong><\/a> kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 ngay b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft b\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi!<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BlwHdMvIQoQj0Vx6x15lnF50g34\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-MM5rdfPIdoFK3sxwIZFlNWXbgkh\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Livestream tr\u00ean TikTok l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VvoodaqxSoZx7WxDtqOl50JWgac\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Livestream tr\u00ean TikTok l\u00e0 t\u00ednh n\u0103ng ph\u00e1t video tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp, cho ph\u00e9p ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem theo th\u1eddi gian th\u1ef1c. Khi livestream, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tr\u00f2 chuy\u1ec7n, gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, chia s\u1ebb ki\u1ebfn th\u1ee9c ho\u1eb7c gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi nh\u1eadn qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u1ea3o t\u1eeb ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem (c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 quy \u0111\u1ed5i ra ti\u1ec1n).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OMGedFlHIoaCpaxaV0tldzNWgQh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd gi\u00fap x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o ra ngu\u1ed3n thu nh\u1eadp hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4613\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4613\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4613\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/60-1.png\" alt=\"Livestream tr\u00ean TikTok l\u00e0 h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c ph\u00e1t video tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp (live video) tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok, cho ph\u00e9p b\u1ea1n giao l\u01b0u, tr\u00f2 chuy\u1ec7n, b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng ho\u1eb7c chia s\u1ebb n\u1ed9i dung v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem theo th\u1eddi gian th\u1ef1c.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/60-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/60-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/60-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/60-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/60-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4613\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Livestream tr\u00ean TikTok l\u00e0 h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c ph\u00e1t video tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp (live video) tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok, cho ph\u00e9p b\u1ea1n giao l\u01b0u, tr\u00f2 chuy\u1ec7n, b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng ho\u1eb7c chia s\u1ebb n\u1ed9i dung v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem theo th\u1eddi gian th\u1ef1c.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"PlWJdEDOKoIrRAxm9nTlIpiqgTb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AeS8d2tM2owGKNxVq5Xl0wFbg0c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-CLpWdQxMZo12KwxYhoUl4M4lglb\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n c\u1ea7n \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng khi live tr\u00ean TikTok<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Swc9d39kGovAcOx1WU7lCZlagZd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec3 livestream tr\u00ean TikTok m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 an to\u00e0n, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n sau:<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GmAadatvlojNZVxAFrXlasvdgQh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n 1: Tu\u1ed5i t\u00e1c<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EfDSdvK6Rox7jIxpVOclKFKigxe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ph\u1ea3i \u2265\u202f16 tu\u1ed5i \u0111\u1ec3 livestream.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HNtodZJSyoXOq5xACGPlo1Qfg1f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>N\u1ebfu \u2265\u202f18 tu\u1ed5i, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn qu\u00e0 \u1ea3o t\u1eeb ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NO38dJm0dob7BHxP8r9ljmslg8f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n 2: S\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i (Followers)<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GmHfdcgyho40n5x9yJ4l4Axxgbb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec1u khu v\u1ef1c, c\u1ea7n \u2265\u202f1.000 followers \u0111\u1ec3 m\u1edf livestream.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CYsodmrODofzw8xCvDzldEnnghh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 livestream v\u1edbi &lt;\u202f1.000 followers, n\u1ebfu n\u1ed9i dung viral ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c TikTok m\u1eddi th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AET0dabzzohmQdxb3TelpslPgtu\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n 3. T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n &amp; h\u1ed3 s\u01a1<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CExXdfjKFohMEixzhP4l3yBPg6g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u00f4ng khai, \u00edt nh\u1ea5t 30 ng\u00e0y tu\u1ed5i, kh\u00f4ng vi ph\u1ea1m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng g\u1ea7n \u0111\u00e2y.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V8s0dKhh6oxUJ2xjAAZlU2uJg4b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n 4. Phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ti3sd6tEBoOgwKxmesilGf0ngrd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C\u1eadp nh\u1eadt TikTok l\u00ean phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n m\u1edbi nh\u1ea5t m\u1edbi hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb t\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn livestream.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4614\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4614\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4614\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/58-1.png\" alt=\"T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ee7 tu\u1ed5i, \u0111\u1ee7 follow, tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch TikTok.\n\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/58-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/58-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/58-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/58-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/58-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4614\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ee7 tu\u1ed5i, \u0111\u1ee7 follow, tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch TikTok.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MM6Kd42wLorG4IxUKyllPT3Jgwf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n 5. Tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O6Pzd6mzkoJEZ5xvde1l4b6AgBe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Kh\u00f4ng vi ph\u1ea1m b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n nh\u1ea1c, video, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NcQEdHx0yo1eY5x2QJYl8X5XgYg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Kh\u00f4ng ph\u00e1t n\u1ed9i dung b\u1ea1o l\u1ef1c, khi\u00eau d\u00e2m, k\u00edch \u0111\u1ed9ng th\u00f9 \u0111\u1ecbch ho\u1eb7c h\u00e0ng c\u1ea5m.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LgyEdqQPRocbSCx7u36lUYa3gJf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Kh\u00f4ng d\u1eabn link, QR, ho\u1eb7c chuy\u1ec3n h\u01b0\u1edbng sang n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng kh\u00e1c.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GQD2dt0Ydo4uXKxMu0ilnBaTgOc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n 6. X\u00e1c th\u1ef1c \u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QhCVdROrIoQ1Z1xBiVWlrSo5ged\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u b\u1ea1n cung c\u1ea5p m\u1ed9t trong c\u00e1c ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p sau \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e1c minh tu\u1ed5i:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DuoJd6rk1oDCOZxFXRmlnl8sgEb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\u1ea2nh selfie + gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd tu\u1ef3 th\u00e2n<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MCp7dbGDpoGbnIx6UpYlfZbpg4e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>X\u00e1c th\u1ef1c th\u1ebb t\u00edn d\u1ee5ng<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SsH1dgCyfoDeqQxb4MgltTQvgwh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\u1ea2nh s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 \u01b0\u1edbc l\u01b0\u1ee3ng tu\u1ed5i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0wedDgPWod98PxnJDal1SONgmc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>G\u1ee3i \u00fd cho nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng:<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IaFddYDp4oPuZDxZS0mlIAjtgAf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n ch\u01b0a \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ee7 followers, h\u00e3y t\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c qua videos ng\u1eafn ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UmZkdGf25oWHyLxVbwRlD30Cg8g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>X\u00e1c th\u1ef1c tu\u1ed5i n\u1ebfu TikTok y\u00eau c\u1ea7u, \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecb gi\u00e1n \u0111o\u1ea1n sau n\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Nkz5d2B67oQyaOxiXdbl6jxMggg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Lu\u00f4n tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch, \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o livestream lu\u00f4n an to\u00e0n v\u00e0 \u2018s\u1ea1ch\u2019.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-LtTDdYV8coJnXTxKrsJl2ahKgKd\" style=\"text-align: left;\">C\u00e1ch livestream tr\u00ean TikTok c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JbjFdWM5vo8VCExzdkMl3j7FgSg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: M\u1edf giao di\u1ec7n livestream<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TRwidEU1IooR2RxCUPklbY0ZgXb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>V\u00e0o TikTok \u2192 Nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o d\u1ea5u \u201c+\u201d \u1edf gi\u1eefa m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TNzwdvpMloBjgxxcROul1YjEgCc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Vu\u1ed1t sang m\u1ee5c \u201cLive\u201d \u1edf thanh menu ph\u00eda d\u01b0\u1edbi (n\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng th\u1ea5y m\u1ee5c Live, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n ch\u01b0a \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n)<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O2CgdOsvDoqZF1xrbmcl0RXugGh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp bu\u1ed5i livestream<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CG8ed2MzfoKA33x9YjdlY8hHgAg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Nh\u1eadp ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ec1 livestream ng\u1eafn g\u1ecdn, thu h\u00fat<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A7pNde7e2ohtxAxJ7JPlCGkBgMb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ch\u1ecdn ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1, hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng, b\u1eadt\/t\u1eaft b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn, l\u00e0m \u0111\u1eb9p n\u1ebfu c\u1ea7n<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DY6HdLa9voqZyHxgt7IlJ4UMgLc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o camera r\u00f5, \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZVIVdZM3SojfAvxAZrulh2YRgOf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: B\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u ph\u00e1t s\u00f3ng<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BmVDddoj6oAQYBxQ4wHlGVo0g0d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Nh\u1ea5n n\u00fat \u201cGo Live\u201d<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OGOadjrwGoZJ5xxSN1elRXv6gud\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Trong khi live, h\u00e3y tr\u00f2 chuy\u1ec7n, tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn, gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u n\u1ed9i dung ho\u1eb7c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DOK3dUD4BoFtwDxmAoOlgBEzg6b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: K\u1ebft th\u00fac bu\u1ed5i live<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EF1OdQYoKovQd4xL6Gslh0RHgqb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Nh\u1ea5n \u201cK\u1ebft th\u00fac\u201d \u0111\u1ec3 d\u1eebng ph\u00e1t s\u00f3ng<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LBZDdkXt1okyfLxyHkwlKqiGgFf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Xem th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea TikTok cung c\u1ea5p: l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem, th\u1eddi l\u01b0\u1ee3ng, s\u1ed1 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4615\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4615\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4615\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/61.png\" alt=\"C\u00e1ch livestream tr\u00ean TikTok \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n \" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/61.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/61-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/61-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/61-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/61-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4615\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">C\u00e1ch livestream tr\u00ean TikTok \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-GqSedgU81ouhF1x9BAglzSDhgtb\" style=\"text-align: left;\">M\u1eb9o livestream tr\u00ean TikTok t\u0103ng m\u1eaft xem, nhi\u1ec1u t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I145d2yP7oyVtIx6hV3lo43Wgge\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">L\u01b0u \u00fd th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf: M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng ph\u1ea3n \u00e1nh r\u1eb1ng d\u00f9 ch\u01b0a \u0111\u1ee7 1.000 followers, h\u1ecd v\u1eabn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c TikTok c\u1ea5p quy\u1ec1n livestream. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y th\u01b0\u1eddng x\u1ea3y ra n\u1ebfu t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u00f3 n\u1ed9i dung viral, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhi\u1ec1u t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c ho\u1eb7c TikTok \u0111ang th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m t\u00ednh n\u0103ng tr\u00ean di\u1ec7n r\u1ed9ng. V\u00ec v\u1eady, h\u00e3y t\u1eadp trung l\u00e0m n\u1ed9i dung ng\u1eafn th\u1eadt t\u1ed1t, v\u00ec video viral c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0 \u201cv\u00e9 th\u00f4ng h\u00e0nh\u201d gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n m\u1edf Live s\u1edbm h\u01a1n d\u1ef1 ki\u1ebfn. V\u00e0 d\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2yy s\u1ebd l\u00e0 c\u00e1c m\u1eb9o b\u1ecf t\u00fai \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u00fap k\u00eanh TikTok c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n t\u0103ng m\u1eaft xem, nhi\u1ec1u t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SRs6dI9Dbo32xTxRqvBlbMP7gVg\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Ch\u1ecdn khung gi\u1edd v\u00e0ng Livestream t\u1eeb 19h\u201322h l\u00e0 kho\u1ea3ng th\u1eddi gian nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi online nh\u1ea5t, gi\u00fap video ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ea3o ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OwUydBKOvoFWpSxSaexluyjbg4b\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb n\u1ed9i dung tr\u01b0\u1edbc So\u1ea1n s\u1eb5n k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n ho\u1eb7c d\u00e0n \u00fd livestream \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh n\u00f3i lan man. N\u00eau r\u00f5 m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau bu\u1ed5i live (giao l\u01b0u, chia s\u1ebb, b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, v.v.) \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef m\u1ea1ch n\u1ed9i dung li\u1ec1n m\u1ea1ch v\u00e0 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UM5gdhdFUoKex8xThMgl6Mq7g9f\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>M\u1edf \u0111\u1ea7u h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn, gi\u1eef ch\u00e2n 10 gi\u00e2y \u0111\u1ea7u Ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh \u1edf l\u1ea1i trong v\u00e0i gi\u00e2y \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean. H\u00e3y b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u b\u1eb1ng m\u1ed9t c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u00fa v\u1ecb, th\u00f4ng tin h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn ho\u1eb7c h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh b\u1eaft m\u1eaft \u0111\u1ec3 \u201cgi\u1eef ch\u00e2n\u201d ngay t\u1eeb \u0111\u1ea7u.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrwGd9e8Yo7Sz9xUCdNlqKMighg\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>T\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c \u0111\u1ec1u tay Ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ecdc v\u00e0 ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn, g\u1ecdi t\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem, \u0111\u1eb7t c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi ng\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ec3 khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch h\u1ecd t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c nhi\u1ec1u h\u01a1n. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 gi\u1eef m\u1eaft xem c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XExIdCJQAoXNekxjFLflUITjgZd\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Ch\u1ea1y qu\u00e0 \u2013 mini game \u2013 \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i flash N\u1ebfu \u0111ang b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, h\u00e3y th\u00eam y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 \u201cgi\u1eadt m\u1eaft\u201d nh\u01b0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng mini game, gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 gi\u1edd v\u00e0ng,&#8230; \u0111\u1ec3 k\u00edch th\u00edch ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem \u1edf l\u1ea1i v\u00e0 ch\u1ed1t \u0111\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HO78d2pRMoFDYTxBCr5lKaSDgOe\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>\u0110\u1ea7u t\u01b0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh, \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng, \u00e2m thanh Ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng video r\u00f5 n\u00e9t, s\u00e1ng s\u1ee7a v\u00e0 \u00e2m thanh \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh s\u1ebd t\u1ea1o c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, d\u1ec5 gi\u1eef ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5LrdzIIXoJoJWxKD3bln3SGgxc\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Duy tr\u00ec t\u1ea7n su\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u1eb7n Livestream th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean theo l\u1ecbch c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh s\u1ebd t\u1ea1o th\u00f3i quen cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem quay l\u1ea1i, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t follow v\u00e0 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c l\u00e2u d\u00e0i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-Q5b3dgSqioMvTOxbWKMlKLgIglv\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"divider\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VJW5d8rtloakZ3xz3Q0lSQfegNe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VcuId23R0o1Y0WxxRjyltYLOgBc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UaVWdoGTrobJXMxjHfblOMeXgCe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IwhQdu4UEoYD61xz0B6lEMY9g8c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZC3RdtmDYonod